{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちわかつき。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"17thの集合カットがあがっている！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"向かって1番左におります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"強めなファッションメイクをしてます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2017/02/14/5459280/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"相変わらずな 甘党を発揮する今日この頃。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"制作やライブリハや個人仕事やグループ仕事など...色々と毎日、有難いことに沢山お仕事させてもらえています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日々、時間と体力消耗との勝負です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"正直今いままでで1番身体がバッキバキ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頭フル回転過ぎて目に見えない位。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それも良いこと、良いこと！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"経験はいずれ身になる！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今のうちに色々挑戦することだね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来週から"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっとは寒さ和らぎそうだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夜とかは冷えるからみんなも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"風邪とか気をつけてね！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"食神様まだまだやってますよー(*ﾟｰﾟ)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よければ、声を聴きに行ってくーださいっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2017/02/14/5459280/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、実は1月に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ロミオ＆ジュリエットも観に行ってた私、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱり生ちゃんの声は最強です。大好き。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"犬夜叉来て欲しいなっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2017/02/14/5459280/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こちらの写真の"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"後ろからひょっこりは 2月28日発売の"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真夏の気圧配置 さん。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2017/02/14/5459280/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいちゅんと雑誌の撮影したよー！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファッション雑誌で一緒は中々無いから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しかったね♪*大人な感じでした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また告知します！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2017/02/14/5459280/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早く、重ね着しないで大丈夫な季節..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"春になって欲しいと切に願う。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではまたねっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ps."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"簡単な事じゃ無かったと思うし、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"正直 色んなことを考える毎日だったと思います。でも きっと自分の武器や目標や夢や...それが何かは人それぞれかもしれないけど新しいものが得れてたら素敵ですね。本番は行けなくて残念だったけど...3期生プリンシパルお疲れ様！！"}],"source":"archive"}